+    /// Removes only the interactions in the given thread that were authored
+    /// by the local user (e.g. outgoing messages, calls placed by the local
+    /// user), leaving interactions from other participants untouched. Syncs
+    /// the deletion to the local user's other linked devices.
+    func removeAllInteractionsAuthoredByLocalUser(
